---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="Collection & Archive | Finicky Bee"
	description="Explore the Finicky Bee collection and archive of vintage and antique objects documented through research, observation, photography, and storytelling."
>
  <main>
        <Header />

    <section class="page-hero">
      <div class="narrow">
        <p class="eyebrow">COLLECTION / ARCHIVE</p>

        <h1>A growing archive of collected objects.</h1>

        <p class="hero-text">
          A curated record of vintage, antique, nostalgic, and collectible
          objects documented through research, observation, photography, and
          storytelling.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="narrow">
        <p class="eyebrow">THE ARCHIVE</p>

        <h2>Objects worth looking closer at.</h2>

        <p>
          The Finicky Bee collection brings together objects discovered through
          collecting, sourcing, and research.
        </p>

        <p>
          Each object may carry its own history, craftsmanship, marks,
          materials, memories, or unanswered questions. The archive exists to
          keep those details connected to the objects they belong to.
        </p>

        <p>
          Some pieces are documented for their historical or collecting
          interest. Others may eventually be offered for sale through selected
          marketplaces. The archive remains focused on the object and its
          story.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section archive-principles">
      <div class="narrow">
        <p class="eyebrow">HOW OBJECTS ENTER THE ARCHIVE</p>

        <h2>Discovery comes first. Documentation follows.</h2>

        <div class="principle-list">
          <article>
            <span>01</span>
            <div>
              <h3>Discover</h3>
              <p>
                Objects are encountered through sourcing, collecting, and
                unexpected discoveries.
              </p>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article>
            <span>02</span>
            <div>
              <h3>Examine</h3>
              <p>
                Physical characteristics, construction, materials, marks,
                labels, and condition are observed carefully.
              </p>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article>
            <span>03</span>
            <div>
              <h3>Research</h3>
              <p>
                Available evidence is studied alongside documented sources and
                relevant historical references.
              </p>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article>
            <span>04</span>
            <div>
              <h3>Document</h3>
              <p>
                Photographs, observations, research findings, and supporting
                information are preserved as part of the record.
              </p>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article>
            <span>05</span>
            <div>
              <h3>Preserve</h3>
              <p>
                The resulting record helps keep the object's story connected
                to the object itself.
              </p>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section archive-note">
      <div class="narrow">
        <p class="eyebrow">A LIVING ARCHIVE</p>

        <h2>The collection will grow over time.</h2>

        <p>
          The Finicky Bee archive is an evolving record. New discoveries,
          research, photographs, and documented objects may be added as the
          collection develops.
        </p>

        <p>
          Not every object has a complete history. When information is
          incomplete or uncertain, that distinction remains part of the record.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section finds-link">
      <div class="narrow">
        <p class="eyebrow">DISCOVER THE STORIES</p>

        <h2>Some archived objects begin as Finicky Bee Finds.</h2>

        <p>
          Follow the documentary process behind selected discoveries and see
          how research and documentation develop around an object.
        </p>

        <a href="/finds" class="text-link">
          Explore Finicky Bee Finds →
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section founder">
      <div class="narrow">
        <p class="eyebrow">THE WORK BEHIND THE ARCHIVE</p>

        <h2>Independent collecting, research, and preservation.</h2>

        <p>
          The Finicky Bee archive is part of an independent collecting and
          research project built around careful observation, responsible
          documentation, and respect for the history carried by objects.
        </p>

        <p>
          Collectibles may be offered for sale through selected marketplaces.
          Those purchases help sustain the time, research, documentation,
          photography, preservation, and storytelling behind the collection.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="site-footer">
      <div>
        <p class="footer-brand">FINICKY BEE</p>
        <p>Preserving Moments in Time — One Collectible at a Time.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="footer-links">
  <a href="/about">About</a>
  <a href="/finds">Finicky Bee Finds</a>
  <a href="/collection">Collection</a>
  <a href="/research">Research</a>
  <a href="/shop">Shop</a>
  <a href="/privacy">Privacy</a>
  <a href="/terms">Terms</a>
</div>

      <p class="copyright">
        © {new Date().getFullYear()} Finicky Bee. All rights reserved.
      </p>
    </footer>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  :global(body) {
    margin: 0;
    background: #f7f3ea;
    color: #2f302c;
    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
  }

    .footer-links a {
    color: #2f4f3f;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
  }

  .page-hero {
    padding: 110px 24px 90px;
    background: #2f4f3f;
    color: #f7f3ea;
  }

  .section {
    max-width: 1180px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 90px 24px;
  }

  .narrow {
    max-width: 780px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    color: #d4a437;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
  }

  h1,
  h2,
  h3 {
    font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.15;
  }

  h1 {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(2.7rem, 6vw, 5rem);
  }

  h2 {
    margin: 0 0 28px;
    color: #2f4f3f;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.4rem);
  }

  h3 {
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    color: #2f4f3f;
    font-size: 1.45rem;
  }

  p {
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .hero-text {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 28px 0 0;
    font-size: 1.12rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .archive-principles {
    background: #ece7da;
    max-width: none;
  }

  .principle-list {
    max-width: 780px;
    margin: 45px auto 0;
  }

  .principle-list article {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 55px 1fr;
    gap: 24px;
    padding: 28px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid #d4a437;
  }

  .principle-list article > span {
    color: #d4a437;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .principle-list p {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .archive-note {
    background: #f7f3ea;
  }

  .finds-link {
    background: #2f4f3f;
    color: #f7f3ea;
    max-width: none;
  }

  .finds-link h2 {
    color: #f7f3ea;
  }

  .finds-link .text-link {
    color: #f7f3ea;
  }

  .founder {
    padding-bottom: 110px;
  }

  .text-link {
    color: #2f4f3f;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .text-link:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .site-footer {
    background: #2f4f3f;
    color: #f7f3ea;
    padding: 55px 24px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 1fr;
    gap: 40px;
  }

  .site-footer p {
    margin: 0 0 8px;
  }

  .footer-brand {
    color: #d4a437;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  }

  .footer-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 16px 22px;
  }

  .footer-links a {
    color: #f7f3ea;
  }

  .copyright {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    padding-top: 25px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(247, 243, 234, 0.2);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {

    .page-hero {
      padding: 80px 24px 70px;
    }

    .section {
      padding: 65px 24px;
    }

    .principle-list article {
      grid-template-columns: 42px 1fr;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .site-footer {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .copyright {
      grid-column: auto;
    }
  }
</style>